<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.css" />
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/leaflet/1.9.4/leaflet.min.js"></script>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Barlow+Semi+Condensed:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>JDA vs JDS pincode coverage, Mumbai</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="data:image/png;base64,">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<style>
  :root {
    /* Territory register (Mumbai) -- asphalt / road-slab / kerb greys, chalk text, Queen's Necklace amber accent
       (the Marine Drive sodium streetlights; Kolkata uses taxi yellow).
       Category colours (--cat-*) encode data and stay user-customisable. */
    --bg: #1c1f24; --panel: #23272e; --panel2: #2b3038; --border: #383e48;
    --text: #eceae4; --text-dim: #a2a39c; --accent: #f59e2a; --on-accent: #1c1f24;
    --tip-bg: #eceae4; --tip-text: #1c1f24; --tip-dim: #5d6069; --tip-accent: #8a4600;
    --font-body: 'Barlow', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --font-display: 'Barlow Semi Condensed', 'Barlow', 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
    --cat-gap: #a855f7; --cat-notpresent: #9b1b43; --cat-nosales: #5b6577; --cat-jdaonly: #22c55e;
    --cat-band1: #ef4444; --cat-band2: #3b82f6; --cat-band3: #22c55e; --cat-outside: #14b8a6;
  }
  :root[data-theme="light"] {
    --bg: #f2f4f5; --panel: #ffffff; --panel2: #e8ecef; --border: #d2d8dd;
    --text: #1d2227; --text-dim: #5d6670; --accent: #a35a00; --on-accent: #ffffff;
    --tip-bg: #1d2227; --tip-text: #f2f4f5; --tip-dim: #aab2b9; --tip-accent: #f59e2a;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size:14px; line-height:1.45; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  header { padding: 24px 28px 16px; position:relative; }
  header h1 { margin:0 0 6px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing: -0.005em; }
  header p { margin:0; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 14px; }
  #lastRefreshed { color: var(--text-dim) !important; font-size: 13px; }
  .layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px; gap: 16px; padding: 16px 28px; max-width: 100%; }
  .panel { background: var(--panel); border:none; border-radius: 6px; padding: 18px 20px; min-width: 0; overflow-x: auto; }
  .controls { display:flex; align-items:center; gap: 18px; padding: 12px 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .seg { display:flex; background: var(--panel2); border-radius: 5px; padding: 3px; gap: 2px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .seg button { background:transparent; border:none; color:var(--text-dim); padding: 6px 14px; border-radius:3px; cursor:pointer; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
  .seg button:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .seg button.active { background: var(--accent); color: var(--on-accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .cards { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; padding: 0 28px 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) { .cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 16px; }
    .cards { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); padding: 0 16px 4px; }
    header, .controls, footer.metrics { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }
  }
  html, body { max-width: 100%; overflow-x: hidden; }
  /* Summary row = the map legend: each category card is a key with a thick bar in its colour.
     Hidden categories keep their bar outline but lose the fill, so state reads without fading. */
  .card { background: var(--panel2); border:1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; padding: 12px 14px; position:relative; }
  .card .num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.05; }
  .card .lbl { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; line-height:1.35; }
  .card.layer-card { --key: var(--text-dim); background: var(--panel); border-left: 8px solid var(--key); padding-left: 14px; cursor:pointer; transition: background-color .12s, border-color .12s; }
  .card.layer-card[data-layer="gap"] { --key: var(--cat-gap); }
  .card.layer-card[data-layer="notpresent"] { --key: var(--cat-notpresent); }
  .card.layer-card[data-layer="nosales"] { --key: var(--cat-nosales); }
  .card.layer-card[data-layer="jdaonly"] { --key: var(--cat-jdaonly); }
  .card.layer-card[data-layer="band1"] { --key: var(--cat-band1); }
  .card.layer-card[data-layer="band2"] { --key: var(--cat-band2); }
  .card.layer-card[data-layer="band3"] { --key: var(--cat-band3); }
  .card.layer-card[data-layer="outside"] { --key: var(--cat-outside); }
  .card.layer-card:hover { border-color: var(--border); border-left-color: var(--key); }
  .card.layer-off { background: transparent; border: 1px dashed var(--border); border-left: 8px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--key) 35%, transparent); }
  .card.layer-off .num { color: var(--text-dim) !important; }
  .card.layer-card .onoff { float:right; font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); }
  .card.layer-off .onoff { color: var(--text-dim); font-style: italic; }
  .card[data-tip] .lbl { text-decoration: underline dotted; text-underline-offset:3px; text-decoration-color: var(--border); }
  [data-tip] { position:relative; }
  .field-inline[data-tip] { cursor:help; text-decoration:underline dotted; text-underline-offset:4px; text-decoration-color:var(--border); }
  [data-tip]:hover::after {
    content: attr(data-tip);
    position:absolute; left:50%; top:100%; transform:translateX(-50%);
    margin-top:8px; width:240px; max-width:70vw;
    background:var(--panel2); color:var(--text); border:1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius:8px; padding:10px 12px; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; font-weight:400;
    white-space:normal; box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35); z-index:60; pointer-events:none;
  }
  [data-tip]:hover::before {
    content:""; position:absolute; left:50%; top:100%; transform:translateX(-50%);
    margin-top:2px; border:6px solid transparent; border-bottom-color:var(--panel2);
    z-index:61; pointer-events:none;
  }
  #map { height: 620px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .legend { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap: 10px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-top:10px; }
  .legend span { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; }
  .dot { width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; display:inline-block; }
  table { width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
  th, td { text-align:left; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); white-space: nowrap; }
  th.num-col, td.num-col { text-align:right; }
  th { position: sticky; top:0; background: var(--panel); color: var(--text-dim); cursor:pointer; user-select:none; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  tbody tr:hover > td { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--panel2) 70%, transparent); }
  .pin-d { font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); }
  .pin-r { color: var(--text-dim); }
  th .th-label { display:block; padding-right:2px; }
  th .th-controls { position:absolute; right:6px; bottom:5px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }
  th .sort-ind { font-size:12px; color:var(--accent, #4da3ff); font-weight:700; min-width:8px; }
  th.sorted { color: var(--text); }
  th .col-filter-icon { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:12px; line-height:1; color:var(--text-dim); opacity:.75; cursor:pointer; padding:2px 6px; border-radius:5px; background:var(--panel2); border:1px solid var(--border); }
  th .col-filter-icon:hover { opacity:1; color:var(--text); border-color:var(--accent); }
  th .col-filter-icon.active { opacity:1; color:var(--accent); border-color:var(--accent); background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 16%, transparent); }
  .col-filter-popup { position:fixed; z-index:200; background:var(--panel2); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; padding:10px; width:230px; max-height:340px; overflow-y:auto; box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.45); font-size:13px; cursor:default; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-title { font-weight:700; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:8px; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-row { display:flex; gap:6px; margin-bottom:10px; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-row select, .col-filter-popup .cf-row input, .col-filter-popup .cf-search { background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px; padding:5px 6px; color:var(--text); font-size:12px; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-row select { flex:0 0 60px; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-row input { flex:1; min-width:0; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-search { width:100%; margin-bottom:8px; box-sizing:border-box; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-selectall { border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom:6px; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-list { max-height:170px; overflow-y:auto; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-item { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; padding:3px 0; color:var(--text-dim); font-size:12px; cursor:pointer; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-item:hover { color:var(--text); }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-actions { display:flex; gap:6px; margin-top:10px; }
  .col-filter-popup .cf-actions button { flex:1; }
  #dataTable { table-layout: fixed; }
  #dataTable td { overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; }
  #dataTable th { white-space:normal; word-break:break-word; line-height:1.25; overflow:hidden; vertical-align:top; padding-bottom:32px; }
  #dataTable col.adv-col { display:none; }
  body.show-advanced #dataTable col.adv-col { display:table-column; }
  tr.gap-row { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cat-gap) 14%, transparent); }
  .pin-expand { display:inline-block; width:14px; color:var(--text-dim); cursor:pointer; user-select:none; }
  .pin-expand:hover { color:var(--accent); }
  tr.expand-row td { padding:0; background:var(--panel2); border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); white-space:normal; }
  .expand-panel { padding:10px 14px 14px 34px; }
  .expand-title { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:var(--text); margin-bottom:6px; }
  .expand-table { width:auto; min-width:320px; font-size:12px; }
  .expand-table th, .expand-table td { padding:4px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); white-space:nowrap; }
  .expand-table th { color:var(--text-dim); font-weight:600; }
  .scroll { max-height: 420px; overflow:auto; scrollbar-color: var(--border) var(--panel); scrollbar-width: thin; }
  .scroll::-webkit-scrollbar { width:10px; height:10px; }
  .scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--panel); }
  .scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border); border-radius:6px; border:2px solid var(--panel); }
  .scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--text-dim); }
  .search { width:100%; padding:8px 10px; border-radius:4px; border:1px solid var(--border); background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); margin-bottom:8px; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size:14px; }
  .search::placeholder { color: var(--text-dim); }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); line-height:1.2; }
  .note { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); line-height:1.55; max-width: 110ch; }
  .badge { display:inline-block; padding:1px 7px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12px; font-weight:600; }
  .badge-gap { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cat-gap) 18%, transparent); color: var(--cat-gap); }
  footer.metrics { padding: 8px 28px 32px; }
  footer.metrics ul { line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 14px; max-width: 110ch; }
  /* notes + how-to: flow into 2 columns on wide screens instead of leaving the right half empty (1 column when narrow) */
  #dqNotes { max-width: none; }
  #dqNotes ul, footer.metrics ul { max-width: none; columns: 2 520px; column-gap: 48px; }
  #dqNotes li, footer.metrics li { break-inside: avoid; }
  footer.metrics li b { color: var(--text); }
  .popup-team { font-size:12px; }
  .popup-team div { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; }
  .adv-col { display: none; }
  body.show-advanced .adv-col { display: table-cell; }
  .toggle-wrap { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-left:auto; }
  .toggle-wrap input { accent-color: var(--accent); width:16px; height:16px; }
  .bars { display:flex; align-items:flex-end; gap:14px; height:140px; padding:10px 4px 0; }
  .bar-col { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; gap:6px; flex:1; cursor:pointer; }
  .bar { width:100%; max-width:44px; background:var(--cat-gap); border-radius:2px 2px 0 0; }
  .bar-col:hover .bar { filter: brightness(1.15); }
  .bar-label { font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dim); }
  .bar-val { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size:15px; font-weight:600; }
  .bar-col.month-selected .bar { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:2px; }
  .rep-row { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:3px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); gap:8px; font-size:12px; }
  .adv-section { display:none; margin-top:10px; }
  body.show-advanced .adv-section { display:block; }
  .pin-list-item { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); cursor:pointer; font-size:12px; }
  .pin-list-item:hover { background: var(--panel2); }
  .pin-list-item .pn { font-weight:600; }
  .pin-list-item .pl { color:var(--text-dim); }
  .period-picker { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .period-picker select, .period-picker input[type=date] { background: var(--panel2); color:var(--text); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:4px; padding:6px 8px; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size:14px; color-scheme: dark; }
  :root[data-theme="light"] .period-picker input[type=date], :root[data-theme="light"] .period-picker select { color-scheme: light; }
  .mini-btn { background: var(--panel2); color:var(--text); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:4px; padding:6px 12px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size:14px; font-weight:500; cursor:pointer; }
  .export-btn { background: transparent; color: var(--accent); border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 55%, transparent); }
  .export-btn:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 12%, transparent); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .mini-btn:hover { color:var(--text); border-color:var(--accent); }
  .field-inline { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dim); }
  .field-inline input[type=number] { width:70px; padding:5px 8px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid var(--border); background:var(--panel2); color:var(--text); font-size:13px; }
  .color-panel { display:none; }
  .color-panel.open { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px,1fr)); gap: 10px 18px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .color-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; }
  .color-row input[type=color] { width:32px; height:28px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:6px; background:none; padding:0; cursor:pointer; }
  .color-row label { flex:1; color:var(--text-dim); }
  .column-panel { display:none; }
  .column-panel.open { display:block; margin-top:12px; }
  .column-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; font-size:13px; padding:5px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border); background:var(--panel); }
  .column-row label { flex:1; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; cursor:pointer; }
  .column-row .col-drag-handle { cursor:grab; color:var(--text-dim); font-size:14px; padding:0 4px; user-select:none; }
  .column-row.dragging { opacity:.4; }
  .column-row.drag-over-top { border-top:2px solid var(--accent); }
  .column-row.drag-over-bottom { border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent); }
  .theme-toggle { position:absolute; top:20px; right:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; }
  .theme-toggle .t-icon { font-size:13px; }
  .switch { position:relative; display:inline-block; width:38px; height:20px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .switch input { opacity:0; width:0; height:0; }
  .switch .slider { position:absolute; inset:0; background: var(--panel2); border:1px solid var(--border); transition:.2s; border-radius:20px; cursor:pointer; }
  .switch .slider:before { position:absolute; content:""; height:14px; width:14px; left:2px; top:2px; background: var(--accent); transition:.2s; border-radius:50%; }
  .switch input:checked + .slider:before { transform: translateX(18px); }
  .band-swatch { width:14px; height:14px; border-radius:3px; display:inline-block; }
  #printExportArea { display: none; }
  #printExportArea h1 { font-size: 17px; margin: 0 0 4px; color: #111; }
  #printExportArea p.pe-meta { color: #555; font-size: 11px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  #printExportArea table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-size: 9px; }
  #printExportArea th, #printExportArea td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 4px 6px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; }
  #printExportArea th { background: #eee; }
  #printExportArea tr:nth-child(even) { background: #fafafa; }
  body.exporting-print > *:not(#printExportArea) { display: none !important; }
  body.exporting-print #printExportArea { display: block; background: #fff; color: #111; padding: 20px; }
  @media print {
    body.exporting-print > *:not(#printExportArea) { display: none !important; }
    body.exporting-print #printExportArea { display: block; }
  }
  #perfViewBody table th { position:relative; white-space:normal; word-break:break-word; line-height:1.25; padding:6px 8px 30px; vertical-align:top; min-width:78px; }
  #perfViewBody table td { white-space:nowrap; }
  /* ---- territory strip: the whole branch as one bar, split by category ---- */
  .summary { margin: 6px 28px 14px; }
  .sum-head { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:10px; }
  .sum-hint { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 13px; }
  .sum-head #bandSettingsBtn { margin-left:auto; }
  .strip-bar { display:flex; gap:0; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .strip-bar span { flex: var(--grow) 1 0; min-width: 8px; background: var(--key); cursor:pointer; }
  .strip .card.layer-card.grp-start { margin-left: 14px; }
  .strip-bar span.off { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--key) 22%, transparent); }
  .cards.strip { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap: 8px; padding:0; margin:0; grid-template-columns:none; }
  .strip .card.layer-card { display:inline-flex; align-items:baseline; gap: 8px; margin:0; padding: 6px 12px 6px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 18px; background: var(--panel); font: inherit; color: var(--text); cursor:pointer; }
  .strip .card.layer-card::before { content:""; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background: var(--key); align-self:center; }
  .strip .card.layer-card:hover { border-color: var(--key); border-left-color: var(--key); }
  /* keep the colour dot on hover: the [data-tip] tooltip arrow also uses ::before and would pull the dot out of the
     chip, shrinking it and making the chip row re-wrap (flicker) */
  .strip .card.layer-card[data-tip]:hover::before { content:""; position:static; transform:none; margin:0; border:0; width:10px; height:10px; }
  .strip .card .num { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; line-height:1; }
  /* counts: a lighter tint of the category colour so dark ones (burgundy) stay readable; bar/map/dots keep the full colour */
  .strip .card .num { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--key) 62%, var(--text)) !important; }
  .strip .card .lbl { font-size: 13.5px; margin:0; color: var(--text); white-space: nowrap; }
  .strip .card.layer-off { background: transparent; border-style: dashed; }
  .strip .card.layer-off::before { background: transparent; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--key) 55%, transparent); }
  .strip .card.layer-off .num, .strip .card.layer-off .lbl { color: var(--text-dim) !important; }
  .strip .card .onoff, .strip .card .only-btn { display:none; }
  .sum-foot { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap: 12px 28px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top: 10px; }
  .kpis { display:flex; gap: 8px 30px; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:baseline; }
  .kpi { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dim); }
  .kpi b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text); margin-right: 6px; }
  .summary .hidden-cat-note { margin:0; padding: 3px 0 3px 10px; background:none; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .summary .hidden-cat-note .mini-btn { padding: 2px 9px; font-size: 13px; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .summary { margin: 6px 16px 14px; } .cards.strip { flex-wrap: wrap; } .strip .card.layer-card { flex-basis: 40%; border-radius: 4px !important; } }
  /* filter chips (replace the old "Showing …" line) */
  #scenarioNote { max-width: none; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .filter-bar { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:8px; }
  .filter-bar .fb-label { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 14px; }
  .chip { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background: var(--panel2); border:1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); border-radius: 4px; padding: 3px 4px 3px 10px; font-size: 13px; }
  .chip button { background:none; border:none; color: var(--text-dim); cursor:pointer; font-size:15px; line-height:1; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius:3px; }
  .chip button:hover { color: var(--text); background: var(--border); }
  .fb-link { background:none; border:none; color: var(--accent); cursor:pointer; font-size:13px; padding:3px 4px; font-family: var(--font-body); }
  .fb-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  /* hidden-category warning */
  .hidden-cat-note { margin: 4px 28px 10px; padding: 9px 12px; border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, var(--panel)); border-radius: 3px; font-size: 14px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap: 6px 12px; }
  .hidden-cat-note .hc-names { color: var(--text-dim); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .hidden-cat-note { margin: 4px 16px 10px; } }
  /* card extras */
  /* Summary tiles (not filters) always start their own row after the category cards. */
  .card.layer-card + .card:not(.layer-card) { grid-column-start: 1; }
  .card .sub { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 14px; color: var(--text); margin-top: 6px; }
  .card.layer-card { padding-bottom: 30px; }
  .card .only-btn { position:absolute; right:10px; bottom:8px; background:none; border:1px solid transparent; color: var(--text-dim); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 3px; cursor:pointer; }
  .card .only-btn:hover, .card .only-btn:focus-visible { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--border); background: var(--panel2); }
  /* Filter bar stays in view while scrolling the long tables below. */
  header + .controls { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 40; background: var(--bg); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; }
  .controls .note { font-size: 14px; }
  .team-toggle-cell { width: 1%; white-space: nowrap; }
  .team-toggle { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 11px; color: var(--text-dim); font: inherit; font-size: 12px; padding: 1px 9px; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; }
  .perf-mgr-row:hover .team-toggle, .team-toggle:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--text); }
  .team-toggle.open { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--text); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 12%, transparent); }
  /* deployed JDAs (on the roster) */
  tr.perf-deployed > td { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 9%, transparent); }
  tr.perf-deployed > td:first-child { box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent); }
  .dep-tag { display:inline-block; margin-left:6px; padding:0 6px; border-radius:3px; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color: var(--text); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 24%, transparent); vertical-align: 1px; }
  .dep-compare { width:auto; min-width: 560px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }
  .dep-compare th, .dep-compare td { padding: 5px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); white-space: nowrap; }
  .dep-compare th { color: var(--text-dim); font-weight: 600; text-align: left; }
  .dep-compare .num-col { text-align: right; }
  .perf-mgr-row b { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: .01em; }
  /* Sub-vertical hover slip: inverted colours so it never blends into the page or the accent. */
  #subvertTooltip { background: var(--tip-bg) !important; border: none !important; color: var(--tip-text); --text: var(--tip-text); --text-dim: var(--tip-dim); box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.45) !important; border-radius: 4px !important; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  /* Accent is for state (active, selected, sorted), not for every name in a 170-row list. */
  .perf-mgr-link { color: var(--text) !important; }
  .perf-mgr-link:hover { color: var(--accent) !important; text-decoration: underline !important; }
  .export-btn { color: var(--text); border-color: var(--border); }
  .export-btn:hover { color: var(--text); background: var(--panel2); border-color: var(--accent); }
  .bars { height: 160px; margin-top: 26px; }
  .bar-col .bar { opacity: .4; }
  .bar-col.month-selected .bar { opacity: 1; outline: none; }
  :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .card.layer-card:focus-visible { outline-offset: 3px; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { *, *::before, *::after { transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; } }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { header h1 { font-size: 24px; } header + .controls { position: static; } .theme-toggle { top: 16px; right: 16px; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="printExportArea" style="display:none;"></div>
<header>
  <h1><img class="jd-logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Justdial" style="height:1.1em; width:auto; vertical-align:-0.16em; margin-right:12px;">JDA vs JDS pincode coverage, Mumbai branch</h1>
  <p id="periodHeaderText">Period: 01 Apr 2026 – 12 Oct 2026</p>
  <p id="lastRefreshed" style="margin-top:4px;color:#6b7690;">Last refreshed: 13 Oct 2026, 02:21 PM &nbsp;|&nbsp; 190 pincodes &nbsp;|&nbsp; 7 gap pincodes</p>
  <div class="theme-toggle" title="Switch dark/light mode">
    <span class="t-icon">🌙</span>
    <label class="switch">
      <input type="checkbox" id="themeCheckbox">
      <span class="slider"></span>
    </label>
    <span class="t-icon">☀️</span>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="controls">
  <div class="seg" id="freshSeg">
    <button data-v="all" class="active">Fresh + Renewal (All)</button>
    <button data-v="fresh">Fresh only</button>
    <button data-v="renewal">Renewal only</button>
  </div>
  <!-- Mumbai: no Main/Remote split, so no City scope filter (Sarvesh, 2026-09-25) -->
  <div class="period-picker">
    <span class="note">Period:</span>
    <input type="date" id="periodFrom">
    <span class="note">to</span>
    <input type="date" id="periodTo">
    <button id="periodResetBtn" class="mini-btn">Full range</button>
    <select id="periodPreset" aria-label="Quick date range"><option value="">Quick range…</option></select>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="controls" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="note" id="scenarioNote" style="margin-top:6px;"></div>
  <button id="colorPanelToggle" class="mini-btn" style="margin-left:auto;">Customize colors</button>
</div>
<div class="controls" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div id="colorPanel" class="color-panel"></div>
</div>

<section class="summary" aria-label="Pincode categories">
  <div class="sum-head">
    <div class="seg" id="viewSeg" role="group" aria-label="Quick views">
      <button data-view="all">All pincodes</button>
      <button data-view="losing" title="Gap, No JDA presentation, and JDA share up to 20%">JDA losing out</button>
      <button data-view="winning" title="JDA only, and JDA share above 20%">JDA doing well</button>
      <button data-view="nosales" title="JDA presenting but nobody selling, and no activity at all">No sales yet</button>
    </div>
    <span class="sum-hint">Click a category to show or hide it.</span>
    <button class="mini-btn" id="bandSettingsBtn" aria-expanded="false">Band settings</button>
  </div>
  <div class="strip-bar" id="stripBar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cards strip" id="cards"></div>
  <div class="sum-foot"><div class="kpis" id="kpis"></div><div id="hiddenCatNote" class="hidden-cat-note" style="display:none;"></div></div>
</section>

<div class="controls band-editor" id="bandEditor" style="padding-top:0; gap:14px; display:none;">
  <span class="field-inline" data-tip="Applies only where both JDA and JDS are selling in a pincode. Splits those pincodes by JDA&#8217;s share of the sales there, so you can see where JDA is losing out. Each band has its own card above.">JDA-share bands</span>
  <label class="field-inline"><i class="band-swatch" style="background:var(--cat-band1);"></i> JDA share up to <input type="number" min="0" max="100" id="cutoff1" value="20"> %</label>
  <label class="field-inline" id="cutoff2Row" style="display:none;"><i class="band-swatch" style="background:var(--cat-band2);"></i> Band 2 up to <input type="number" min="0" max="100" id="cutoff2" value="20"> %</label>
  <span class="note" id="band3Note" style="display:none;"><i class="band-swatch" style="background:var(--cat-band3);"></i> Band 3 above that</span>
  <span class="note" id="band1Rest"><i class="band-swatch" style="background:var(--cat-band2);"></i> above that = JDA doing well</span>
  <button class="mini-btn" id="addBandBtn" style="display:none !important;">Split the rest into 2 bands</button>
  <button class="mini-btn" id="resetBandBtn" style="display:none;">Back to 1 band</button>
</div>

<div class="layout" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
  <div class="panel">
    <h3>All pincodes</h3>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:8px;">
      <input class="search" id="searchBox" placeholder="Search pincode or place name..." style="flex:1; min-width:200px; margin-bottom:0;">
      <button class="mini-btn" id="viewAllBtn" title="Toggles all filters/layers/search off (and back) so every pincode shows below">Show every pincode</button>
      <button class="mini-btn" id="columnPanelToggle">Columns</button>
      <button class="mini-btn export-btn" id="exportExcelBtn">Export CSV</button>
      <button class="mini-btn export-btn" id="exportPdfBtn">Export PDF</button>
    </div>
    <div class="note" id="mgrFilterBadge" style="display:none; margin-bottom:8px; color:var(--accent);"></div>
    <div id="columnPanel" class="column-panel"></div>
    <div style="margin-bottom:10px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <div class="note" style="margin:0;">Click a column to sort. Click a row to see who worked that pincode. Exports match what's shown.</div>
      <button id="clearSortBtn" class="mini-btn">Reset sort</button>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll">
      <table id="dataTable">
        <colgroup id="tableColgroup"></colgroup>
        <thead>
          <tr id="tableHeadRow"></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div id="colFilterPopup" class="col-filter-popup" style="display:none;"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="layout" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
  <div class="panel">
    <h3>Manager &amp; JDA performance</h3>
    <div class="note" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Counts only the pincodes shown in the table above, so it follows every filter. Click a pincode row above to split its figures by manager and JDA.</div>
    <div class="note" id="pincodeFilterBadge" style="display:none; margin-bottom:8px; color:var(--accent);"></div>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:10px;">
      <div class="seg" id="perfViewSeg">
        <button data-v="manager" class="active">Manager view</button>
        <button data-v="jda">JDA view</button>
      </div>
      <input class="search" id="perfSearchBox" placeholder="Search manager or JDA name..." style="flex:1; min-width:200px; margin-bottom:0;">
      <button class="mini-btn" id="expandAllManagersBtn" type="button" title="Open or close every manager to see their JDAs">Expand all</button>
      <button class="mini-btn" id="showAllManagersBtn" title="Clear search, column filters, and any pincode filter">Show all managers</button>
    </div>
    <div id="perfDeployCompare"></div>
    <div class="scroll" id="perfViewBody" style="max-height:480px;"></div>
    <div id="perfColFilterPopup" class="col-filter-popup" style="display:none;"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="layout">
  <div class="panel">
    <h3>Pincode map</h3>
    <div id="map"></div>
    <div class="legend" id="legend"></div>
    <div class="note" style="margin-top:6px;">Colour = category, size = deals closed. Filled shapes are real pincode boundaries; dashed circles mark pincodes with no boundary on file, placed at their centre. Click a shape for its detail.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel">
    <h3>Pincodes on the map</h3>
    <div class="scroll" id="filterListBody"></div>
    <h3 style="margin-top:18px;">Pincode detail</h3>
    <div id="detailPanel" class="note">Click a pincode on the map or in the list above to see its sales split, JDS teams, deployed JDAs and how recently JDA visited.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="layout" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
  <div class="panel">
    <h3>Gap pincodes by month</h3>
    <div class="bars" id="monthBars"></div>
    <div class="note">Click a bar to limit the whole dashboard to that month. Bar heights always count Fresh and Renewal together.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="layout" style="grid-template-columns: 1fr;">
  <div class="panel">
    <h3>Data quality notes</h3>
    <div class="note" id="dqNotes"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer class="metrics">
  <h3 style="padding-left:0;">How to use the filters and tools</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Categories</b>: click a category (or its part of the bar) to show or hide those pincodes in the table, the map, the totals and the manager figures. <b>Quick views</b> set several at once: All pincodes, JDA losing out (Gap, No JDA presentation, JDA share up to 20%), JDA doing well (JDA only, JDA share above 20%) and No sales yet. A hidden category still shows its count, and the line under the chips says how many pincodes are hidden, with <b>Show all</b>.</li>
    <li><b>JDA-share bands</b>: open <b>Band settings</b>. There are two: “JDA share ≤20%” and “JDA share &gt;20%”. You can change the 20% cutoff there; <b>JDA doing well</b> always means above it.</li>
    <li><b>Sorting</b>: click a column header to sort by it; click it again to flip the direction. Shift-click more columns to add tie-breakers (numbered ¹ ² ³ in the header). <b>Reset sort</b> goes back to the default order.</li>
    <li><b>Column filters</b>: click the ▾ under any column header for a greater/less-than filter (numbers) or a checklist (Pincode, Place, State, Gap). Works in both tables.</li>
    <li><b>Search</b>: the pincode search matches pincode or place name; the manager search matches manager or JDA name.</li>
    <li><b>Export CSV / PDF</b>: exports exactly the rows shown in the pincode table, with its search, category cards, column filters, period, Fresh/Renewal choice and sort order.</li>
    <li><b>Show every pincode</b>: turns every filter, category and search off in one go; <b>Restore my filters</b> brings them back.</li>
    <li><b>Pincode detail</b>: the ▸ at the start of a row opens its top sales groups by deals closed and by monetizable listings. Hover a row inside for its breakdown.</li>
    <li><b>Who worked a pincode</b>: click a pincode row to split that pincode's presentations and JDA sales by manager and JDA, for the current period and filters. <b>Show all managers</b> returns to the full list.</li>
    <li><b>A manager&#8217;s JDAs</b>: managers are listed collapsed. Click <b>▸ N JDAs</b> next to a manager to see their JDAs, or <b>Expand all</b> to open every manager.</li>
    <li><b>A manager's pincodes</b>: click a manager's name to filter the pincode table to every pincode their team worked (all categories are switched on while this filter is active).</li>
    <li><b>Period</b>: use the From / To dates, pick from <b>Quick range</b> (this month, last month, last 7 / 30 days, financial-year quarters), or click a bar in the monthly chart. <b>Full range</b> resets it.</li>
    <li><b>Active filters</b>: everything that narrows the view shows as a chip under the filter bar; × removes one, <b>Clear all</b> removes them all (categories have their own <b>Show all</b>).</li>
    <li><b>Copy link to this view</b>: copies a link that opens the dashboard with the same filters, categories and bands. Reloading the page also keeps them.</li>
    <li><b>Colors</b>: <b>Customize colors</b> repaints every category and band; the choice is saved in this browser only.</li>
  </ul>
</footer>

